From: Bob Parkinson <rwplists@omni.ac.uk> :

I do all my administration from a PC with Exceed in CDE, and you seem to 
be attempting to use it differnetly to me. I've set up my exceed to run 
xdmcp query to my alphaserver, running in single window mode. This is 
done from the Xconfig program, Communication, mode setting.

When I start exceed, it gets a chooser list of avaliable servers, and I 
can selet my box, and get a logon prompt.

