From: "Landert Rene" <Rene.Landert@bakom.admin.ch>

my setup in Exceed is the following:
Start Xconfig, choose "Communication", set Mode to XDMCP-query,
configure this mode as Connect Host to the name of your Unix Server,
Display Class and Key must be empty.
Then choose "Windows Mode", set Windw Mode to Single.
Then restart the Exceed Server on your PC.

with this setup you should get the login screen o the CDE on the DU
server.

