X-MARC-Message: https://marc.info/?l=tru64-unix-managers&m=96078708811829

The answer to the problem of permissions was quite simple and a stupid mistake on my
part, I didn't reset the SUID bit on the sendmail binary.
Thanks to John P Speno for this quick answer.
The original problem was a bunch of permission errors which would prevent delivery
of the mail because the /var/spool/mqueue wouldn't allow writting the mail in the
