k
ncheck/vncheck by manually insert an entry for all the locally mounted Ad=
vFS
domains but this is not good if the system goes down and the AdvFS domain=
s
are overtaken by another ASE cluster host)
Dr. Tom Blinn suggested 'tag2name' but I am not quite sure how to interpr=
et
the file handles in the above message into a valid entry in the .tags
directory.
Anyone able to give me a clue; Tom perhaps ?
