Building a GNU environment=0A=
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=
=3D=3D=0A=
=0A=
1. Get all relevant software=0A=
=0A=
	- download from any GNU mirror site the following files:=0A=
=0A=
		binutils-2.8.1, bison-1.25, cvs-1.9, flex-2.5.4, gcc-2.8.0, =
gdb-4.16,=0A=
		glibc-2.0.6, gzip-1.2.4, less-332, libg++-2.8.0, libstdc++-2.8.0,=0A=
		make-3.75, ncurses_1.9.9g, termcap-1.3, texinfo-3.11=0A=
=0A=
	- extract via gzip and tar into separate subdirectories=0A=
=0A=
=0A=
3. Configure gcc build=0A=
=0A=
	- read INSTALL!=0A=
=0A=
	- set PATH so `/usr/bin' precedes `/usr/ucb'=0A=
=0A=
	- ignore directions about moving g++ source tree to below current =
directory, g++ is now=0A=
	  part of normal build=0A=
=0A=
	- disable current gcc (so broken, it breaks build)=0A=
=0A=
	- run ./configure in gcc source directory with the following flags:=0A=
=0A=
		./configure --with-stabs			// We'll be using gdb=0A=
=0A=
=0A=
4. Build and install compilers:=0A=
=0A=
	- build stage1 gcc with system cc:=0A=
=0A=
		make clean					// Just in case=0A=
		make LANGUAGES=3Dc				// More languages later=0A=
		make stage1						=0A=
=0A=
	- build stage2 gcc with stage1 gcc:=0A=
=0A=
		make CC=3D"stage1/xgcc -Bstage1/" CFLAGS=3D"-g -O2"	// Makes all =
languages=0A=
		make stage2=0A=
=0A=
	- build stage3 gcc with stage2 gcc:=0A=
=0A=
		make CC=3D"stage2/xgcc -Bstage2/" CFLAGS=3D"-g -O2"=0A=
=0A=
	- compare stage2 and stage3 compilers:=0A=
=0A=
		make compare					// Any differences are SERIOUS=0A=
=0A=
	- up to now, you can have been making the compilers in any user =
directory=0A=
	  to perform the full install, you must alter all references in the =
Makefile=0A=
	  you have been using (you actually built it in the configure step =
above) to=0A=
	  now refer to your desired target directory=0A=
=0A=
		cp Makefile Makefile.prev			// Save previous=0A=
		vi Makefile					// Make your changes=0A=
		prefix=3D/usr/local				// Line 210=0A=
=0A=
	- install the compiler driver, the compiler's passes and run-time =
support:=0A=
=0A=
		make install CC=3D"stage2/xgcc -Bstage2/" CFLAGS=3D"-g -O"=0A=
	=0A=
=0A=
9. Build C++ environment=0A=
=0A=
	- SET SHELL VARIABLE (VERY IMPORTANT) (PUT IT IN YOUR .myprofile, =
TOO!)=0A=
=0A=
		CC=3Dgcc=0A=
=0A=
=0A=
