All-

Regarding my question about DEC 3000 machines and supported video at DU 4.x,
I received responses from:

Gyula Szokoly <szgyula@tarkus.pha.jhu.edu>
Harvey Rarback 630-252-0427 <RARBACK@cars3.uchicago.edu>
